      <section v-if="isProfessionalReview && !isArchive" class="professional-review"><el-alert title="比赛状态：裁判已提交 · 待主办方复核" type="warning" :closable="false" show-icon/><section class="pro-score"><div><small>场序</small><b>{{ match.matchSequence }}</b></div><div><small>日期时间</small><b>{{ matchDateText }}</b></div><div><small>比赛场地</small><b>{{ match.venue }}</b></div><strong>{{ homeName }}　{{ match.homeScore }} : {{ match.awayScore }}　{{ awayName }}</strong><div><small>主裁判</small><b>{{ mainRefereeName }}</b></div><div><small>提交时间</small><b>{{ submittedAtText }}</b></div></section><nav class="professional-review-tabs"><span class="active">赛果概览</span><span>事件流水</span><span>裁判报告</span><span>电子比赛记录</span><span>签字与确认</span></nav><section class="pro-evidence"><article><h2>双方阵容快照（已上报）</h2><div class="pro-team"><b>{{ homeName }}</b><span>首发 11 人　替补 7 人　本方总计 18 人</span><el-button plain size="small">查看详情</el-button></div><div class="pro-team"><b>{{ awayName }}</b><span>首发 11 人　替补 6 人　本方总计 17 人</span><el-button plain size="small">查看详情</el-button></div><h2>裁判团队</h2><p>主裁判　{{ mainRefereeName }}　　第一助理裁判　李明</p><p>第二助理裁判　张伟　　第四官员　赵磊</p></article><article><h2>完整事件流水（共 {{ sortedEvents.length }} 条）</h2><div v-for="event in sortedEvents" :key="`pro-${event._id}`" class="pro-event"><b>{{ event.minute }}′</b><span>{{ event.teamName }}</span><strong>{{ event.playerName }}</strong><em>{{ eventLabel(event) }}　{{ event.score }}</em></div><el-button plain>查看完整事件</el-button></article><article><h2>裁判报告（已上报）</h2><p>比赛结果　{{ homeName }} {{ match.homeScore }} : {{ match.awayScore }} {{ awayName }}</p><p>公平竞赛　良好</p><p>情况说明　无重大情况</p><el-button plain>查看完整报告</el-button><h2>电子比赛记录（已生成）</h2><p>记录状态　已生成（共 {{ sortedEvents.length }} 条事件）</p><el-button plain>查看电子比赛记录</el-button><h2>签字与确认（已完成）</h2><p>主裁判签字　已签字　　双方球队　已确认</p></article></section><footer class="pro-actions"><el-button type="warning" plain @click="openReturnDialog">退回裁判修正</el-button><el-button type="success" :loading="saving" @click="archiveRecord">确认无误